{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1147306201"}, "name":{"label":"Kolo & Klan"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-29T00:07:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.13.3"}, "id":{"label":"12949502025"}, "title":{"label":"The best habit tracker out there"}, "content":{"label":"After having tried out multiple habit trackers before, I discovered this one through a YT video and man am I glad that I found this beautiful app. \n\nThe UX is super simple and well designed. The UI keeps the core things at the forefront while keeping everything else hidden. The biggest thing - the joy of seeing your “habit commits” grow and grow with every passing day. \n\nIt doesn’t guilt you for missing out on things either. You just start over again and it’s all good.  Great app for anyone who struggles with starting and maintaining their habits", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
