{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1726257347"}, "name":{"label":"nakeup"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-22T08:33:23-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.10.3"}, "id":{"label":"12450937418"}, "title":{"label":"No lock-screen widget"}, "content":{"label":"I got to know about the app from a Youtube creator who had a HabitKit widget on his lock-screen. However, when I installed the app, I couldn’t find it. I thought it was with a subscription and I got the annual plan but I still can’t find the lock-screen widget in the list. Have the developers removed it for lock-screen and kept it for home screen only?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id544153179"}, "name":{"label":"raj kev"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-15T03:04:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.10.2"}, "id":{"label":"12313286063"}, "title":{"label":"Best habit tracker ever!"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve tried a bunch of habit trackers (both free & paid). While most of them were decent, this one is a LITERAL HIDDEN GEM! \n\nThe best part of Habitkit:\n1. Colour coded grid view (single best feature of this app)\n2. Simplicity to the max \n3. Unlimited trackable habits (pro only tho) \n4. Monthly trend view \n5. Total completions, Best & current streak \n6. Super clear icons \n7. Tags to group habits under unique groups \n8. Timely reminders for each habit (life saver!)\n9. Data export/import \n\nOverall, this app has helped me increase my productivity, thanks to the motivation i get looking at the monthly grid view & analytic data.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id963470893"}, "name":{"label":"Pratik Gadhesariya"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-04T08:48:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.10.1"}, "id":{"label":"12144484396"}, "title":{"label":"Minimal design and great value"}, "content":{"label":"I really like the approach of this habit building app. Very simple and easy to use no more unnecessary complexity. I always like this kind of concept. Thanks for making this app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1182138458"}, "name":{"label":"Arghya Chakraborty"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-12-18T02:51:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.10.0"}, "id":{"label":"12076964228"}, "title":{"label":"Perhaps the BEST Habit Tracker Available."}, "content":{"label":"I’ve tried a bunch of habit trackers, but HabitKit is hands down the best one I’ve found. It’s super user-friendly and has all the features you need to stay on track and be your best self.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
