{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id551114181"}, "name":{"label":"travBrob"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-05-29T11:23:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.8"}, "id":{"label":"11320994085"}, "title":{"label":"Fits my needs exactly !"}, "content":{"label":"'ve been using this habit tracker app for a while now, and I must say it’s fantastic! The user interface is clean and intuitive, making it easy to track and manage my daily habits. One feature that stands out is the ability to set multiple completions per day. This is incredibly useful for tasks that require incremental progress, like studying for a few hours or drinking multiple glasses of water.\n\nI initially overlooked this feature, but after some exploration, I found that you can customize the completions per day and track your progress in a visually appealing way. The app uses a shading system similar to GitHub's contributions graph, where the intensity of the color increases with the number of completions. This visual feedback is motivating and helps me stay on track.\n\nOverall, the app is well-designed, feature-rich, and highly customizable. It's perfect for anyone looking to build and maintain new habits. Highly recommended!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
